        closedAt: "v4574 -- ARMED, AT THE COMMAND LINE ONLY, AND THE FIRST WAY I ARMED IT WAS WRONG. "
            + "Flipping runQuickSweep's own default to true armed it for EVERY caller at once -- nine besides "
